1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:13,958
An irony Moyn enjoys: in nineteen seventy four the Nobel Prize in economics was shared by Gunnar Myrdal, who believed the welfare idea could go worldwide, and Friedrich Hayek, the champion of free markets.

2
00:00:13,958 --> 00:00:18,255
One was forgotten; the other saw his fondest wishes come true.

3
00:00:18,255 --> 00:00:26,549
The human rights movement adapted to the new climate, prizing freedom from harm and a minimal state, and the ceiling was forgotten.

